<title>FRANCE: Axa holds 7 pct Elf voting rights.</title>
<headline>Axa holds 7 pct Elf voting rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Axa holds 7.19 percent of the voting rights of energy company Elf Aquitaine, the bourse regulator Conseil des Marches Financiers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Axa declared its interest rose above the five percent threshold on April 21 due to a doubling of voting rights. It now holds 18,862,776 Elf voting rights.</p>
<p>Last week Elf said two of its subsidiaries bought back two million Elf shares, or 0.7 percent of its capital, sold by Axa's UAP-Vie subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
